{% layout none %}
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>Atelier Elunora · Photo Station</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'atelier-station.css' | asset_url }}"></head>
<body><main id="station"><header><p class="eyebrow">ATELIER ELUNORA</p><h1 id="title">Photo station</h1><p id="event-name">Connecting to your event…</p></header><p id="demo-label" hidden>DEMO ONLY · Photos are not uploaded or saved.</p><p id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<section id="capture" hidden><div class="camera"><video id="camera" autoplay muted playsinline></video><img id="review" alt="Review your photo" hidden></div><p>Keep faces near the center for your square magnet.</p><div class="actions"><button id="start">Enable camera</button><button id="switch" hidden>Switch camera</button><button id="take" hidden>Take photo</button><button id="retake" hidden>Retake</button><button id="accept" hidden>Use this photo</button></div><p class="small">Choosing “Use this photo” sends it to this event’s private gallery and the attendant’s print queue. Only submit photos you have permission to share.</p></section>
<section id="printing" hidden><p>New photos appear automatically every 5 seconds. Open a job to review its crop and quantity.</p><label>Queue status <select id="queue-filter"><option value="pending">Pending</option><option value="printing">Printing / needs confirmation</option><option value="held">Held</option></select></label><button id="refresh">Refresh queue</button><div class="workspace"><div id="jobs" aria-label="Print queue"></div><section id="editor" hidden><h2 id="job-title">Review photo</h2><canvas id="crop" width="750" height="750" aria-label="Square crop preview"></canvas><label>Zoom <output id="zoom-value">1.00×</output><input id="zoom" type="range" min="1" max="3" step="0.01" value="1"></label><button id="reset-crop">Reset crop</button><label>Horizontal crop <input id="x" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50"></label><label>Vertical crop <input id="y" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50"></label><label>Magnet quantity <input id="quantity" type="number" min="1" max="12" value="1"></label><label>Cut size, inches <input id="cut" type="number" min="2.5" max="2.9" step="0.01" value="2.5"></label><p class="small">Prototype layout: landscape 6 × 4 inch sheets, up to two squares per sheet at 300 pixels per inch. Confirm your cutter’s required paper size, including wrap/bleed, before use. Print at 100% / actual size, with headers and footers off. Disable borderless enlargement and verify with a ruler.</p><div class="actions"><button id="prepare">Prepare sheets</button><button id="hold">Hold photo</button><button id="printed" hidden>Confirm physically printed</button><button id="retry" hidden>Return to pending</button></div><p id="print-note"></p></section></div><section id="sheet-controls" hidden><h2>Prepared print sheets</h2><p>Inspect the sheets below, then open the print dialog. Confirm physically printed only after checking the actual output.</p><button id="print">Open print dialog</button><div id="downloads"></div></section></section>
<footer><button id="close">Close this station on this device</button><p class="small">Keep this device awake and online. Ask the attendant if you need help.</p></footer></main><div id="sheets"></div>
<script type="module" src="{{ 'atelier-station.js' | asset_url }}"></script></body></html>
